        "language": "english",
        "review": "I've played through the demo...and had to pick this up day one. Its a great RE style game.\n\nAs far as your choices...this game doesn't hit the magic that The Killing Antidote has, but it still has a really good mood. It is also a bit cheaper than TKA, but not by a whole lot. Also, like when you really get into TKA, this one doesn't feel like a horn dog fest it looks to be at first glance. It is clear the developer wants this to be a darn good game. I don't think this game will disappoint.\n\nIf you don't have both, I can't recommend this over TKA, but it is really close. My recommendation: pick them both up and enjoy both of them.",
